secure-terminal-gsl-salvage-team-name = GSL Salvage Team
secure-terminal-gsl-salvage-team-desc = Contracts the Gemini Star Logistics' local Salvage team to engage active station threats.
    Recommended when no Security personnel are present, or when Security cannot respond without assistance.
secure-terminal-gsl-salvage-team-announcement = The Gemini Star Logistics' local Salvage team has been contracted to engage active station threats.

secure-terminal-dismiss-gsl-salvage-team-name = Dismiss GSL Salvage Team
secure-terminal-dismiss-gsl-salvage-team-desc = Ends the Gemini Star Logistics' assistance contract and returns their team to standard duties.
    Recommended once all threats to the station have been dealt with.
secure-terminal-dismiss-gsl-salvage-team-announcement = The Gemini Star Logistics' contract has ended and their Salvage team has returned to standard duties.